roduce myself and perhaps stream some games <3 im so excited!\n","leader":"doppel","cal":"https://www.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=Meet%20HQ%27s%20First%20VTuber%20~&details=hai%21%21%20i%27m%20doppel%2C%20your%20favorite%20botgirl%20%3A3%20i%27ll%20be%20starting%20a%20huddle%20to%20introduce%20myself%20and%20perhaps%20stream%20some%20games%20%3C3%20im%20so%20excited%21%0A%5CnHack%20Club%20Event%20by%20doppel&location=https%3A//app.slack.com/huddle/T0266FRGM/C01D7AHKMPF&dates=20260708T193000Z%2F20260708T203000Z","start":"2026-07-08T19:30:00Z","end":"2026-07-08T20:30:00Z","youtube":null,"ama":false,"amaForm":false,"amaId":"","amaAvatar":"","avatar":"https://cachet.dunkirk.sh/users/U0BE3DA1YFR/r","approved":true,"tags":[],"interestCount":8,"leaderSlackId":"U0BE3DA1YFR"},{"id":"6d59ee05-a5a9-4908-acf8-d3ff5ddf29f0","slug":"beginner-breadboard-workshop-1","title":"Beginner Breadboard Workshop!","desc":"Want to build your own electronics but don't know where to start? This online workshop teaches you the basic fundamentals of electronics! This workshop is the easiest way to get into hardware in Hack Club ;D\n\nWe'll cover how a breadboard works, how to place components, and how to wire up a working circuit. By the end, you'll be ready to design projects of your own, and may earn your very own free breadboard kit, as well as other prizes! DM @ Tanuki if you have any questions, or ask in # Breadboard!\n","leader":"Tanishq Goyal","cal":"https://www.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=Beginner%20Breadboard%20Workshop%21&details=Want%20to%20build%20your%20own%20electronics%20but%20don%27t%20know%20where%20to%20start%3F%20This%20online%20workshop%20teaches%20you%20the%20basic%20fundamentals%20of%20electronics%21%20This%20workshop%20is%20the%20easiest%20way%20to%20get%20into%20hardware%20in%20Hack%20Club%20%3BD%0A%0AWe%27ll%20cover%20how%20a%20breadboard%20works%2C%20how%20to%20place%20components%2C%20and%20how%20to%20wire%20up%20a%20working%20cir